# Trivy ignore list. Each entry MUST carry a justification and a dated expiry.
# Format: CVE-ID  # <reason>; expires <YYYY-MM-DD>
# Empty by default: unfixed HIGH/CRITICAL base-image CVEs are handled by rebuilding on the
# newest python:3.12-slim digest (https://clinic.ericgitangu.com/architecture#base-image-cve), not by blanket ignores.
